/Title (You can see it in what they choose to cook with. The beef is Texas HeartBrand Akaushi. The bread comes from Kraftsmen Baking right here in Houston. The ice cream is Tillamook. And there's something you won't find in their kitchen at all: a conventional deep fryer. Take the Chicken Fried Steak, which is about as Texas comfort food as it gets. At Lynn's Table it starts with beef tenderloin, gets hand-breaded, then shallow-fried in beef tallow. Same dish you grew up on, made the way a classically trained chef would make it.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1143 0 R
/Prev 1244 0 R
/Next 1391 0 R
>>
endobj
1343 0 obj
<<
/Title (After 11 years, Matthew and Jessica know a lot of their guests by name. Their tables have hosted birthdays, anniversaries, date nights and long lunches with friends. Their favorite compliment? When someone discovers Lynn's Table and comes back with somebody they want to introduce to it. We'd love for you to be that someone this month.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1143 0 R
/Prev 1392 0 R
/Next 1245 0 R
>>
endobj
